---
source: crates/ym-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: "help(&[\"doctor\"])"
---
Print the diagnostics that go into a bug report

Usage: ym doctor [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --json             Print the report as JSON
  -q, --quiet            Print only errors on stderr
      --bench <FILE>     Time the render path on this photo and print that report instead of the diagnostics. Follows YELLOWMOON_GPU (off for the CPU). The report names no file
  -v, --verbose          Print what is happening on stderr: stages, timings and notes
      --repeat <REPEAT>  With --bench: how many times the same JPEG is exported to check that the bytes are equal [default: 10]
  -h, --help             Print help
